# Frontend Environment Variables Template
# Note: Any variable prefixed with VITE_ will be bundled and exposed in client-side code.
# Do not store private keys or sensitive credentials here.

# Backend API URL (optional)
# - Leave empty during local development to use the local Vite proxy (`/api` -> http://127.0.0.1:8000).
# - When deployed (e.g. Netlify), set this in your Netlify dashboard to your live backend URL (e.g. https://your-backend.onrender.com).
VITE_API_BASE=
